  "weixin_html": "<section data-side-margin=\"0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#1f2937;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/xm1dT1jCe8lIO3P2oFVtd1x040PKGCRPN033gUTrHQQz0Licdqug5X1QgUPQBRCicoTqdYMrpgk7etibXLkK9rwcg/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" alt=\"关注提示\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 0 8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8f1 0%,#ffffff 100%);\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0 16px 20px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#f97316;letter-spacing:0.08em;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Daily Model Hub</p><h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:#111827;font-weight:800;\">每日精选HuggingFace热门模型</h1><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;\">2026-11-12 · Hugging Face 热门模型速览</p></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#1 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-11-12/01-xtools-at-deepseek-v4-pro-qwen3-5-9b-uncensored-heretic.png\" alt=\"xtools-at/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-Qwen3.5-9B-UNCENSORED-heretic\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">xtools-at/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-Qwen3.5-9B-UNCENSORED-heretic</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">该模型是基于DeepSeek-V4-Pro-Qwen3.5-9B进行去审查化处理的版本，利用Heretic v2.0.0.dev0工具构建。通过移除原始模型的行为限制，该版本旨在为需要不受限制输出的用户提供更灵活的对话体验，适用于对内容生成自由度有特定要求的各类自然语言处理任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-11-12/02-minimaxai-minimax-h3-image.png\" alt=\"MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Image\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3-Image</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">MiniMax-H3-Image是MiniMax推出的开放权重多模态模型，具备出色的图像理解与处理能力。该模型定位为多模态智能基座，能够高效完成各类图像相关任务，适用于需要复杂视觉解析、语义理解及跨模态交互的应用场景，为开发者提供高性能的视觉处理工具支持。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-11-12/03-speridlabs-idol.png\" alt=\"speridlabs/idol\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">speridlabs/idol</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">idol是一款能够通过单张图像生成3D高斯喷溅（3D Gaussian Splatting）模型的创新工具。它能够根据一张物体照片推断出模型背面等不可见区域的细节，生成多达百万个高斯点。该模型主要用于快速重建3D场景与物体，适用于游戏开发、虚拟现实及数字内容创作领域。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-11-12/04-nousresearch-arete-27b.png\" alt=\"NousResearch/Arete-27B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">NousResearch/Arete-27B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Arete-27B是基于阿里Qwen3.8-27B基座模型进行后续训练的版本。开发者通过强化训练旨在使该模型体现西方价值观，从而在中文语境训练的基础上实现价值观的平衡与调整。该模型主要适用于需要特定文化价值导向的文本处理与对话辅助任务，旨在探索大模型的价值对齐方式。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-11-12/05-lightricks-ltx-2-5.png\" alt=\"Lightricks/LTX-2.5\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Lightricks/LTX-2.5</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LTX-2.5是由Lightricks推出的多模态模型，该版本重点优化了模型卡片的许可证合规性与规范化管理。作为一款功能强大的视觉模型，LTX-2.5旨在提供高质量的图像或视频生成能力，适用于创意设计、视觉媒体自动化处理等应用场景，支持开发者在合规前提下进行多样化的视觉内容创作。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEUYlkLeB2vgvuhnUoyqoPg1etjxySFodeOgR45dHqS2s2kZ8KyjA65MCPMPbBBGo/0?wx_fmt=gif\" alt=\"底部引导\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section></section>",
